<title>UK: UDO profit edges up, total div up 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>UDO profit edges up, total div up 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		15.32		  vs 15.31</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.75		   vs 7.08</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.5		   vs 9.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     6.55		   vs 6.52</p>
<p> Turnover		   53.03		  vs 52.43</p>
<p> Operating profit	 5.63		   vs 5.49</p>
<p> Interest receivable    0.93		   vs 0.83</p>
<p> Tax			  2.05		   vs 2.05</p>
<p> Net taxed		  5.00		   vs 4.47</p>
<p> Attributable	     1.36		   vs 1.66</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 13</p>
<p> Div registration date  November 19</p>
<p> Ex-div date		November 11</p>
<p>NOTE - Reprographics and drawing office supplies company UDO Holdings Plc said medium and long-term growth prospects in the UK looked good especially in reprographics although recovery in construction and engineering industries is likely to be slower.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
